          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 13121,
            "text": "<!doctype html>\n<!--IF YOU FORGET TO UPDATE EVERYTHING I *WILL* CRY!-->\n<!--Times forgotten...: 1 (which is I guess enough to justify automating some of this)-->\n<html>\n\n<!--\nAnyways so Hai! If you're looking at this code you're probably trying to make your own website, or at least have a\nlittle bit of webdev desire. I'd recommend making one, it's really fun! Don't say about dumb things like \"ohh but I\ndon't know how to code! I'm not smart enough to do that!\" because it's not true. You, YOU, can do anything you want, if\nyou just try. I know it can be hard, but take this as inspiration. Do it. Make a website. I give you full permission to\nsteal from my website if you need something but don't know how to do something! That's the great part of making your own\nwebsite, you can just take stuff from other websites! Go forth and type some letters!!\n-->\n\n<head>\n    <title>Asta!</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/style/update-log.css\" />\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/style/style.css\" />\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/favicon.png\" />\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"./scripts/site-updates.js\"></script> <!-- Automatically updates the site update log -->\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Asta/OctoRocket\" />\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"My home page: a satellite drifting through space\" />\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div id=\"outer-bound\" class=\"clear column\">\n        <!--Title-->\n        <div class=\"column main-section\">\n            <marquee scrollamount=\"15\" class=\"home-video\">\n                <p>\n                    &spades;\n                    Do not judge someone based on anything but their actions.\n                    &clubs;\n                    Don't be a bigot or I'll personally ban your IP from accessing this server.\n                    &diamondsuit;\n                    This is a website safe for all queer people; aspec and trans people are queer too.\n                    &hearts;\n                </p>\n            </marquee>\n            <p class=\"title-intro-text\">\n                <span id=\"title-title\" class=\"description\">The Impure Function:</span>\n                <span id=\"title-name\">ASTA</span>\n                <span id=\"title-title\" class=\"description\">, orbiting the abyss of some far off land...</span>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <!--Under construction!-->\n        <div id=\"under-construction\" class=\"container text-holding home-video main-section\">\n            <div class=\"container clear\">\n                <img src=\"assets/under-construction.png\" height=\"75\" style=\"margin-right: 1rem;\">\n                <p>This webpage is under <em>heavy</em> construction. Please mind the holes.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <!--Main content-->\n        <div class=\"clear container main-section\">\n            <div id=\"left-column\" class=\"clear column\">\n                <!--About me!-->\n                <div>\n                    <h3>About me!</h3>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>I don't really care about how you decide to address\n                        me as long as I know that I'm being addressed. Use\n                        whatever way you find most convenient.</li>\n                        <li>How very useful a section!</li>\n                        <li>Oh yeah also something maybe important to note: The\n                        way I'm presenting myself here is a combination of my\n                        experiences over the time I've had to update this\n                        website. If it looks like my opinions are all over the\n                        place, that's because you're looking what is soon to be\n                        a year of my life compressed over a few sparse website\n                        updates.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <!--Where you can find me!-->\n                <div>\n                    <h3>Where you can find me!</h3>\n                    <p>First and foremost, you can reach me on discord at\n                        octorocket.dev! Since I don't have a guest box set up, this is\n                        the best way to contact me!\n                    </p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>octorocket.dev (Discord)</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://github.com/OctoRocket\">\n                            OctoRocket </a> (GitHub)\n                        </li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"aed6dacbcfc3d6cbc0c1eec9c3cfc7c280cdc1c3\">[email&#160;protected]</a> (Email)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>Soon there will be a list of other places you can find me, right here! Maybe...</p>\n                </div>\n                <!--Website updates!-->\n                <div>\n                    <p>Updates:</p>\n                    <div id=\"site-update-block\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!--My blinker!-->\n                <div>\n                    <h3>My blinker!</h3>\n                        <div style=\"border-color: #11cc66; padding: 0.5rem;\" class=\"column\">\n                            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\">Size: x1</p>\n                            <a style=\"margin: 0 auto;\" href=\"https://asta.octorocket.dev/\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/asta-blinker.gif\">\n                            </a>\n                            <textarea readonly>\n<a href=\"https://asta.octorocket.dev/\"><img src=\"https://asta.octorocket.dev/assets/asta-blinker.gif\"></a>\n                            </textarea>\n                            <br>\n                            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\">Size: x2</p>\n                            <a style=\"margin: 0 auto\" href=\"https://asta.octorocket.dev/\">\n                                <img src=\"assets/asta-blinker-2x.gif\">\n                            </a>\n                            <textarea style=\"width: auto;\" readonly>\n<a href=\"https://asta.octorocket.dev/\"><img src=\"https://asta.octorocket.dev/assets/asta-blinker-2x.gif\"></a>\n                            </textarea>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!--My friends!-->\n                <div>\n                    <h3>My friends' sites!</h3>\n                    <!--Kaf-->\n                    <a href=\"https://sea-of-colors.neocities.org/\"><img src=\"https://file.garden/Zhv5YDnnzDVjn52y/button2.png\" alt=\"Kaf's website\"></a>\n                    <!--zsls-->\n                    <a href=\"https://zsls.octorocket.dev/\"><img src=\"https://zsls.octorocket.dev/image/badges/zsls_badge88x31.png\" alt=\"ZSLS's website\"></a>\n                    <!--fuzz-->\n                    <a href=\"https://fuzz.nekoweb.org/\"><img src=\"https://fuzz.nekoweb.org/Buttons/88x31fuzz.png\" alt=\"Fuzz's website\"></a>\n                    <p>\n                        Awesome people above! More coming soon..?\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <!--Things I've made section-->\n                <div>\n                    <h3>Cool stuff!</h3>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/solitaire.html\">Solitaire (probably functional!)</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/blog.html\">My blog! It's probably mostly about making this website...</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/untitled-1/index.html\">Untitled 1</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"right-column\" class=\"clear column\">\n                <!--Status-->\n                <div class=\"home-video\">\n                    <div id=\"status-box\" class=\"container clear\">\n                        <p>Status:</p>\n                        <!--UPDATE: Change your status-->\n                        <marquee direction=\"left\" scrollamount=\"12\" style=\"font: 1.5rem 'G.B.BOOT', monospace;\">\n                            <p>\n                                Toiling with many things, my website possibly\n                                the least of them.\n                            </p>\n                        </marquee>\n                    </div>\n                    <!--NOPDATE: Change last edited date! Should now be automated-->\n                    <div id=\"update-tracker\" class=\"clear container\">\n                        <p>Last update:</p>\n                        <p id=\"last-updated\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!--Intro-->\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"description\">\n                        A satellite circles some black void in space... It beeps out a distress signal, hoping for\n                        someone to\n                        come to the rescue. Or at least it was, your sensors don't pick up any organic life left... You\n                        have\n                        found a mutable simulated consciousness, one that belongs to one \"Asta\".\n                    </h3>\n                    <p>\n                        Welcome to my satellite! Make yourself at home! I'm Asta, also known as OctoRocket or XTeamXeno\n                        depending on which account you are looking at. I'm still working on this website, as is\n                        blatantly\n                        obvious. Hope to see you around soon!\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        This page is... very heavily inspired by\n                        <a href=\"https://sea-of-colors.neocities.org/\">my friend Kaf's website</a>.\n                        His website is the reason that I decided to make this website in the reason I decided to make\n                        this\n                        website in the first place! If you're reading this, thanks for the inspiration!\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <!--About me-->\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"description\">\n                        You carefully align your ship next to the satellite. Without a word from the satellite, it\n                        deploys a\n                        blindingly thick swarm of nanodrones which immediately surround your ship. You hear your ship's\n                        hull\n                        groan as it is forcefully welded to the satellite. Your hear a hole being bored into the side of\n                        your\n                        ship. Before you can turn your head to look at the damage, air from the satellite is already\n                        rushing\n                        in. It looks homely... someone used to live here. You hear... footsteps? Maybe someone still\n                        does...\n                    </h3>\n                    <p>\n                        Now, how about I (almost) properly introduce myself! I'm Asta, a |-| year old &gt;=|=&lt; who\n                        enjoys programming, video gaming (of most genres!), listening to music (of just as many genres)\n                        (when I remember to), ruining my computer in various ways, and talking to people! I suppose I\n                        also like using way too many parentheses, and <a href=\"./untitled-1/index.html\"></a>this writing\n                        thing</a> is pretty cool too!\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        I'm a large proponent of free (libre) and open source software. I use Linux (NixOS) as my\n                        operating system of choice and love this OS to death (probably unhealthily at this point). I\n                        both feel self conscious about seeming to know a lot about computers and also like to brag about\n                        it. I measure the amount I know by looking at the amount I don't know, which happens to be a\n                        lot. Maybe that isn't the best idea when it comes to self esteem. /shrug\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <!--Uhhh.... link to the blog section or whatever... no more lore here!!!-->\n                <div>\n                    <p class=\"description\" style=\"font-size:larger;\">\n                        Pss, hey! If you're interested more about my life, check <a href=\"/blog.html\">here</a>, it's\n                        where I'll put off topic stuff!\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script defer src=\"https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v833ccba57c9e4d2798f2e76cebdd09a11778172276447\" integrity=\"sha512-57MDmcccJXYtNnH+ZiBwzC4jb2rvgVCEokYN+L/nLlmO8rfYT/gIpW2A569iJ/3b+0UEasghjuZH/ma3wIs/EQ==\" data-cf-beacon='{\"version\":\"2024.11.0\",\"token\":\"04a6844113e44bf3a3b516e61f18d5e3\",\"r\":1,\"server_timing\":{\"name\":{\"cfCacheStatus\":true,\"cfEdge\":true,\"cfExtPri\":true,\"cfL4\":true,\"cfOrigin\":true,\"cfSpeedBrain\":true},\"location_startswith\":null}}' crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>\n"
          },
